  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Update dependency vite to v8.3.8 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/673\r\n* Update dependency node to v24.22.3 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/674\r\n* Update dependency @testing-library/user-event to v14.6.10 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/675\r\n* Update dependency @apitomy/common-ui-components to v4.1.3 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/677\r\n* Select event source from a dropdown when filtering the event stream by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/676\r\n* Update dependency io.apitomy:apitomy-flow-engine to v3.0.6 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/679\r\n* Update dependency @apitomy/flow-ui to v3.0.6 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/678\r\n* Upgrade Apitomy Flow to 3.0.6 by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/680\r\n* Render Flow human-task markdown body in the inbox; show inputs as a striped table by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/682\r\n* AI-generated summaries for workflow runs by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/683\r\n* Update actions/setup-java digest to d1374f8 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/684\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/compare/v3.0.5...v3.0.6",
